      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The dragon is targeted with an attack</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The dragon raises its wing, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the dragon is flying, it descends 10 feet after the attack is complete.</p>",
